#!args --verify-dirty --autosave-dir build/jfn_autosave
# the recovery bar (doc/autosave.rs) after a session that did not end well: autosave.uis (run
# just before) left a copy of two_pcs.jfnet with PC2 deleted and PC1 moved.  Wiederherstellen
# opens it with its file, unsaved; this session holds the copy until it keeps one of its own.
# The script ends before that, as a crash would: autosave_reopen.uis (next) gets the copy
# offered again.  The shot keeps the folder of the copies (see autosave.uis).
shot build/jfn_autosave/recover.png
theme light
expect "Ungespeicherte Änderungen an „two_pcs.jfnet“ gefunden" exists
expect button:"Wiederherstellen" exists
expect button:"Verwerfen" exists
expect button:"Später" exists
shot build/jfnetworker/autosave_recover.png
click button:"Wiederherstellen"
expect "Ungespeicherte Änderungen an „two_pcs.jfnet“ gefunden" missing
expect "„two_pcs.jfnet“ wiederhergestellt" exists
expect text:"2 Geräte · 1 Kabel" exists
expect text:"geändert" exists
expect listitem:"PC2" missing
expect listitem:"PC1" exists
theme dark
shot build/jfnetworker/autosave_recover_dark.png
expect_nowarn
